The translator language list (translator.js) comes from MeeTranslate
(github.com/smyhu/meetranslate-n9, MIT).
Google Translate and its speech are Google services; AI answers come from
the service you choose, under that service's terms.

Offline speech: eSpeak NG 1.52.0 (https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng),
GNU General Public License version 3 or later, see espeak-ng/COPYING.
Shipped unmodified as a separate program in /opt/hal2027/espeak; built for
the N9 from the Debian source espeak-ng_1.52.0+dfsg. The ru, cmn and yue
dictionaries are left out to save space.
Corresponding source: https://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/e/espeak-ng/espeak-ng_1.52.0+dfsg.orig.tar.gz
(build script build-espeak-arm.sh in the HAL 2027 sources).

